DESCRIPTION:Hebcal joins you in remembering Yitzhak ben Avraham\, whose 55
 th Yahrzeit occurs on Monday\, January 18\, corresponding to the 10th of S
 h’vat\, 5787.\n\nYitzhak ben Avraham’s Yahrzeit begins at sundown on S
 unday\, January 17 and continues until sundown on the day of observance. I
 t is customary to light a memorial candle at dusk as the Yahrzeit begins.\
 n\nMay your loved one’s soul be bound up in the bond of eternal life and
  may their memory serve as a continued source of inspiration and comfort t
 o you.
